[[576,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the guard (1b).</p><p>2. Fit the tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.630.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the bolt (3a) and remove the spacer (3b) and drive pulley\n(3c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014977.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<p>Fit the drive pulley and fix it with the\nspacer and bolt to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt with left hand thread</p></td><td><p>TOOTHED DRIVE PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M16</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>30.6 - 37.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.630.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the protection and bolt in place.</p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the flywheel shield cover (1b).</p><p>2. Fit the flywheel lock.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.846.001</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2068957.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the (left hand thread) bolt (1a) and remove the drive pulley\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2068958.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the drive pulley back in its housing\nand secure it tightening the bolt to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt with left hand thread</p></td><td><p>TOOTHED DRIVE PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>323  357</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the flywheel lock.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.846.001</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Place the flywheel shield back in its housing\nand secure it using the bolts.</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal